    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      304.97,
      401.89,
      341.75
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Land (Restrictions onAlienation) (Amendment) Act, No. of 2018 and shall comeinto operation on April 1, 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      355.85,
      401.88,
      392.51
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 3 of the Land (Restrictions on Alienation)Act, No. 38 of 2014 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended in subsection (1):\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      406.61,
      401.88,
      443.27
    ],
    "text": "(a)by the repeal of paragraph (b) of that subsection andthe substitution therefor of the followingparagraph:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      209.13,
      457.37,
      401.87,
      481.43
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(b)a condominium parcel specified under theApartment Ownership Law:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      233.85,
      495.53,
      401.89,
      544.91
    ],
    "text": "Provided that, the entire value shall bepaid upfront through an inward foreignremittance prior to the execution of therelevant deed of transfer;\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      559.01,
      401.86,
      595.67
    ],
    "text": "(b)in paragraph (h) of that subsection by thesubstitution for the words \u201ctransfer of such land.\u201dof the words \u201ctransfer of such land; and\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      609.77,
      401.86,
      633.83
    ],
    "text": "(c)immediately after paragraph (h) of that subsectionby the addition of the following new paragraph:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
